\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . Though tribulations befall the children of God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 But the light of their souls continue to glow.
\par What gifts the King of heaven has  bequeathed to them,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par No one can imagine to themselves alone.
\par What none has ever seen nor any hand has touched
\par Is what goes into the make of spirit and soul
\par And helps them to possess the glory of their God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  By their disposition they are Adam's descent;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj And by their constitutions earthly natured.
\par And they are prone to all mortal experiences;
\par They do eat and so drink as is necessary;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj By their livelihood, their sleep and their  living;
\par They are not observed to be of any difference.
\par Except that they loath the vain pleasures of the world.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In spirit they are the heirs of God Almighty;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj It's He Who had begotten them by His word.
\par It is the love of God that glows within their hearts,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Their milk of sustenance is Jesus' message.
\par Angels of the heaven are their related beings
\par With whom they all sing the praises of the Most High,
\par And their music is so clear and so enjoying.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Some day, their Life, their Redeemer and their Master
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Will reveal Himself unto the whole wide world.
\par Then they shall come into the light by all His friends
\par And all the world shall look on them with so joy.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then shall receive from Jesus, peace everlasting.
\par Then they will no longer remember their labour
\par \pard     And their joy will remain  forth forever more.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

